    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Fitzgerald Chambers are delighted to present this unique investment opportunity comprising of three own door apartments in the heart of Kilmainham. This attractive period house has been thoughtfully converted into three apartments, offering a fantastic investment opportunity/small landlord/pension fund.  \r\n\r\nThe property is laid out in 3, two-bedroom units, fully self-contained and in very good condition throughout.  It is fully let and is generating €74,000 per annum. On street disc parking is available.  \r\n\r\nThe area is host to a range of cultural attractions including the Royal Hospital Kilmainham, the Irish Museum of Modern Art (IMMA) and Kilmainham Gaol.  The Phoenix Park and the War Memorial Gardens are within walking distance and provide a wealth of opportunities to occupy leisure time.  St James’s Hospital is close by.  There are grocery shops and cafés within easy walking distance of the property.  \r\n\r\nThe location is served by excellent transport services including rail links from Heuston Station, the Luas line and various bus routes.  There is a Dublin Bikes station nearby at station number 12 Royal Hospital.\r\n\r\nThis is a great opportunity to acquire a fantastic investment property in a highly convenient and well-established neighbourhood!"
      },
